  "id": "everyday-creativity",
  "term": "everyday creativity",
  "definition": "Everyday creativity is creativity as it appears in ordinary daily life and situations. It refers to creative thought or behavior shown across routine events and activities, rather than only in exceptional or formal creative work.",
